// What is under a point and what has focus, for the sidecar's input rules (remotepolicy.mjs): role, labels (of the
// element and 3 parents, and their roles), secure, the focused field's rect, macOS secure input, the front window's default button,
// and whether the Mac is locked. Labels only: never a field's value (that could be what was typed).
import AppKit
import ApplicationServices
import Carbon

/// Owner's hard limit 1 in the phone's hands: A3's credential-field words (CRED_FIELD and EXPIRY in
/// sidecar/hardlimits-core.mjs), generated by sidecar/test/swiftsync.mjs (node test/swiftsync.mjs --write).
